{
  "info": {
    "name": "Codeberg API (Forgejo)",
    "description": "Core subset of the Forgejo/Gitea-compatible REST API served by Codeberg, the community-run non-profit Git hosting platform. Base URL: https://codeberg.org/api/v1. Authenticate with a personal access token sent as `Authorization: token YOUR_TOKEN`. Grounded in the live Swagger at https://codeberg.org/swagger.v1.json.",
